        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-ANNSIM-SIMAUD-PHASE2-STRATEGY.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-PHASE2-STRUCTURAL-STATE.
            05  WS-ABSTRACT-PRESENT         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-INTRODUCTION-PRESENT     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-METHODOLOGY-PRESENT      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-CASE-STUDY-PRESENT       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-CONCLUSION-PRESENT       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-PHASE2-PROOF-CODE        PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-VERIFY-STRUCTURAL-SECTIONS.
            GOBACK.
        1000-VERIFY-STRUCTURAL-SECTIONS.
            IF WS-ABSTRACT-PRESENT = 1 AND
               WS-INTRODUCTION-PRESENT = 1 AND
               WS-METHODOLOGY-PRESENT = 1 AND
               WS-CASE-STUDY-PRESENT = 1 AND
               WS-CONCLUSION-PRESENT = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-PHASE2-PROOF-CODE
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-PHASE2-PROOF-CODE.
